            <description><![CDATA[<p><em>Two corrections around starting the break early.</em></p>
<h3>Improved</h3>
<ul><li>The play button in the countdown window now sits inside a ring, so it reads as a button</li><li>Ring and triangle light up in your accent colour on hover</li></ul>
<h3>Fixed</h3>
<ul><li>A block ended early with the play button counts in full towards the recovery break again — until now that break arrived one block late</li></ul>
]]></description>
